# Project-level Dropbox ignore reference
# NOTE: Dropbox does NOT read this file. The actual ignore rules live at:
#   /Volumes/KLEANDOC/Dropbox/rules.dropboxignore (Dropbox root)
#
# This file exists as documentation for developers. The real enforcement
# happens via:
#   1. rules.dropboxignore at the Dropbox root (new files)
#   2. xattr flags on existing directories (set by dev-start.sh)
#
# Directories that MUST be ignored (platform-specific native binaries):
node_modules
.next
out
.vercel
*.log
.DS_Store
